{c: Verse 1}
[F#m]Mehram Tuhi [Bm]Hai Mera,        Le [D]Sunle [C#m]Meri Dasta [F#m]an
Ranji [F#m]shein Dhuaan [Bm]Dhuaan Si Ye,        Aa [D]Rehle [C#m]Tu Bhi Yah [F#m]an
Noor Na [F#m]Rukte Saah Bhi Na [A]Mukde,        Ke [Bm]Agg Ban Gaya Hai [E]Lahu Mera
Teri [F#m]Raza Hai Dard [A]Maza Hai,        Le [Bm]Hunn Ban Gaya Bad [E]shah Tera
Aaja Leke [F#m]Jayun Tujhe,        Saanse [E]Ghutti Jahan
Khwahishein Jo [Bm]Tooti Si Thi,        Bikhra [E]Unka Jahan
Dafan Ho [F#m]Dono Yahan,        Fir Bhi [E]Ho Tanha
Kare Jo Bhi [Bm]Sajda Tera,        Kehna [E]Tu Hi Meri Hai Mehram
[F#m]Jana Tha Yaa [D]do Ka Ek Ashi [Bm]yana,        Tera [C#m]Khwabo Me Muzko [D]Satana [E]Hmm
